---
// Problem/Solution Section
---

<section class="problem-solution">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <!-- Problem Column -->
      <div class="problem-column">
        <div class="column-header">
          <h3 class="column-title">The Problem</h3>
          <span class="column-emoji">⚠️</span>
        </div>

        <ul class="issue-list">
          <li class="issue">
            <span class="icon">✗</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Studio shoots cost 5k+</strong>
              <p>Traditional photography is expensive, time-consuming, and you wait weeks.</p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="issue">
            <span class="icon">✗</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Inconsistent brand aesthetic</strong>
              <p>Different photographers, different styles—your brand looks scattered.</p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="issue">
            <span class="icon">✗</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Limited angle variations</strong>
              <p>Can't easily test new markets or product angles without another expensive shoot.</p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="issue">
            <span class="icon">✗</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Manual editing & revisions</strong>
              <p>Endless back-and-forths. Revisions cost extra money and burn time.</p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="issue">
            <span class="icon">✗</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Can't scale fast</strong>
              <p>Seasonal updates, new products, new markets—it all takes months to execute.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Solution Column -->
      <div class="solution-column">
        <div class="column-header">
          <h3 class="column-title">Our Solution</h3>
          <span class="column-emoji">✨</span>
        </div>

        <ul class="solution-list">
          <li class="solution">
            <span class="icon">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>€19-35 per image</strong>
              <p>10x cheaper than traditional shoots. Scales with your growth.</p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="solution">
            <span class="icon">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>On-brand consistency</strong>
              <p>AI learns your aesthetic. Every visual matches your brand perfectly.</p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="solution">
            <span class="icon">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Unlimited angle variations</strong>
              <p>Test new angles, new markets, new seasons—generate as many variations as you need.</p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="solution">
            <span class="icon">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>3 revision rounds included</strong>
              <p>No surprises. Revisions are built-in, not an extra fee.</p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="solution">
            <span class="icon">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Scale instantly</strong>
              <p>Need 500 images for a new product line? Done in 5 days instead of 5 months.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-solution {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: #F8F9FA;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
  }

  .problem-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .solution-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .column-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .column-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .column-emoji {
    font-size: 28px;
  }

  .issue-list,
  .solution-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .issue,
  .solution {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .issue:hover,
  .solution:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .issue .icon {
    color: #FF6B35;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .solution .icon {
    color: var(--accent-success);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .issue div,
  .solution div {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .issue strong,
  .solution strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .issue p,
  .solution p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .problem-solution {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }

    .grid {
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .column-title {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }

    .issue,
    .solution {
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
